{
  "bookId": "hero-211204",
  "id": "bond-27545",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "27545001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "买给我吧——\n蜜瓜生蚝味的限定款涂料是我一生的执念！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "这么奇怪的东西，你真的愿意用吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "不管不管！不用摆着看也要买！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "萝贝卡，不可以这么任性。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "呜呜......求求你，我真的很想很想要！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "除了|101|，我已经没有别人可以依靠了......",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "27545008",
              "text": "好吧，服了你。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "27545009",
              "text": "不行就是不行。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "27545007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "耶！你是世界上最最最——好的主人！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "呜呜呜呜哇哇啊——！！！喜欢的东西不能买，也没有人陪我玩，萝贝卡实在太寂寞了！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "好吧......接下来，我会多陪陪你的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "说话算数？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "当然。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "27545014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "萝贝卡",
          "text": "那今天一整天，不，今年一整年，都和萝贝卡一起度过吧！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
